('combat', 'shrine_display_id', NULL, 363.0, 'count', 'Pylons and shrines P3 (diablocraft-7h5tr; docs/proposals/pylons.md 6.7 (b)): the gameobject display every shrine''s object (D3''s shrines share one look, 6.7 (b)) wears. PLACEHOLDER: a stock WoW object the designer picks on dev with .dc pylon spawn <kind> (no Blizzard art, 2026-10-05); it starts at the progress orb''s stock look (363, rifts gr_orb_display_id) as 6.7 says. Read by generate_pylon_objects.py into combat_0054_pylon_objects.sql, so a change needs the generator rerun and that migration applied, not a .dc tunables set'),
('combat', 'shrine_empowered_cooldown_reduction_pct', 50.0, NULL, 'percent', 'Empowered Shrine (docs/proposals/pylons.md 4.3): cooldowns are this much shorter (a Temporary contribution, the class''s cooldown aura rebuilt). D3: 50% (Blizzard''s guide, Fandom). The effect reads this live (.dc tunables set moves it); the buff''s tooltip text is baked from it by generate_spells.py (pylons.md, data/pylon_buffs.csv), so a changed number also needs the generator and a client patch to show the new text.'),
