('combat', 'shrine_enlightened_xp_pct', 25.0, NULL, 'percent', 'Enlightened Shrine (docs/proposals/pylons.md 4.3): experience from the wearer''s own kills is this much higher, multiplied after the sheet''s gear bonus ("multiplicative with items giving a +% bonus to EXP", Fandom). D3: 25% (Blizzard''s guide, Fandom). The effect reads this live (.dc tunables set moves it); the buff''s tooltip text is baked from it by generate_spells.py (pylons.md, data/pylon_buffs.csv), so a changed number also needs the generator and a client patch to show the new text.'),
