('combat', 'shrine_share_radius_yards', NULL, 50.0, 'yards', 'Pylons and shrines P3 (diablocraft-7h5tr; docs/proposals/pylons.md 6.4 (b)): a shrine''s click gives its buff to the party members on the clicker''s floor within this distance of the clicker (a pylon reaches the whole floor). PLACEHOLDER: D3 publishes no radius (D8: ''on the visible screen''); 50 is the near end of Maxroll''s ''your screen edges (50 to 60 yards)'', the start 6.4 gives. The designer sets it'),
