('combat', 'storm_crow_fireball_damage_pct', NULL, 150.0, 'percent', 'Storm Crow (legendary 051, N-WPROC): the fiery ball''s damage, in percent of weapon damage, dealt as fire under the hit record 83560. No source gives it (d3planner''s leg_stormcrow states only the chance [20-40]; docs/research/legendary-pow-data.csv has no Storm Crow Power file), so the number is the designer''s: 150 (card q-1016-20). Blank reads 0: the ball is not cast.'),
('combat', 'wall_of_man_shield_pct_of_max_life', NULL, NULL, 'percent', 'Wall of Man (diablocraft-44hz9): the size of the shield of bones, as a percent of the wearer''s maximum Life. PLACEHOLDER for the designer: the power file''s ''Shield Absorb Percentage'' is 0.25 (decode_pow.py power itemPassive_Unique_Shield_011) but it states no base; the item text, d3planner and the archived tooltips give none. Maximum Life is the reading the sheet''s Wizard armors use for an absorb, offered as the answer to confirm. Blank reads 0: no shield is put and the chance is not rolled.'),
