('economy', 'wing_shirt_vendor_gold', NULL, 0.0, 'gold', 'Codex literal audit 229; mod-diablocraft/scripts/generate_wings.py:263; Wing shirt vendor buy/sell prices; origin: generated SQL comment: tunables, cosmetic shirts/no prices/level 1/bind on pickup; Columns BuyPrice and SellPrice are zero.'),
('loot', 'ancient_chance_pct', 10.0, NULL, 'percent', 'diablocraft-t3t8 (ruling 2026-10-10, docs/decisions.md). The chance that a Legendary or Set drop is Ancient, from the ancient_min_tier up and at ancient_min_item_level or more, from every source (kills, chests, Kadala, the first-kill legendary, the set cache). D3: kadala.csv ancient_chance_at_level_70 (10%), drop_rates.csv ancient_primal (roughly 10% at Torment X)'),
('loot', 'ancient_min_item_level', 70.0, NULL, 'level', 'diablocraft-t3t8. The lowest item level (the monster''s level at the drop, the character''s level for a gamble) that can drop an Ancient or Primal. D3: drop_rates.csv ancient_primal, kadala.csv ancient_chance_at_level_70 (level 70)'),
('loot', 'ancient_min_tier', 5.0, NULL, 'count', 'diablocraft-t3t8. The lowest difficulty tier id that can drop an Ancient or Primal: 5 is Torment I (dc_tier_phase: Normal 1, Hard 2, Expert 3, Master 4, Torment I 5). D3: drop_rates.csv ancient_primal (level 70 Legendary or Set items on Torment I and above)'),
('loot', 'ancient_min_tier_gamble', 0.0, NULL, 'count', 'diablocraft-ax80n (ruling q-1013-21, D3''s rule). The lowest difficulty tier id that lets a Kadala gamble, a slot vendor sale, a Kanai''s Cube roll or an artisan craft come out Ancient or Primal: 0 is no tier gate, the item level alone (ancient_min_item_level) decides, on any difficulty. A monster drop keeps ancient_min_tier. D3: kadala.csv ancient_chance_at_level_70 (if character is level 70), drop_rates.csv ancient_primal gamble/craft/transmute (no Torment gate named)'),
('loot', 'aoe_range_yards', NULL, 30.0, 'yards', 'Area looting range: your own drops on every corpse of yours within this many yards of you show in one window. The designer, q-0930-59 (option 1, 30 yards); docs/proposals/corpse-loot-minimum.md M6. The code clamps it to 5-100'),
('loot', 'blood_shard_cap_base', 500.0, NULL, 'count', 'diablocraft-gw9h; docs/proposals/kadala.md 4.2 (ruling q-1007-08). The most Blood Shards an account holds in one mode before any Greater Rift is beaten alone. D3: kadala.csv blood_shard_capacity_base (500)'),
('loot', 'blood_shard_cap_per_gr_level', 10.0, NULL, 'count', 'diablocraft-gw9h; docs/proposals/kadala.md 4.2 (ruling q-1007-08). Blood Shards added to the cap for each Greater Rift level the account has beaten alone in time in that mode, its best, kept when the character is deleted. D3: kadala.csv blood_shard_capacity_increase_per_gr (+10)'),
('loot', 'full_roll_primary_affixes', 4.0, NULL, 'count', 'from rarity_tiers.csv:rarity=Rare.primary_affix_max, rarity_tiers.csv Rare primary_affixes ''up to 4'' and secondary_affixes ''up to 2'' (max 4 primary + 2 secondary)'),
('loot', 'full_roll_secondary_affixes', 2.0, NULL, 'count', 'from rarity_tiers.csv:rarity=Rare.secondary_affix_max, rarity_tiers.csv Rare primary_affixes ''up to 4'' and secondary_affixes ''up to 2'' (max 4 primary + 2 secondary)'),
('loot', 'kadala_legendary_pct', 10.0, NULL, 'percent', 'diablocraft-aeo7; docs/proposals/kadala.md 4.7 (ruling q-1007-08). The flat chance that a Kadala gamble is a legendary or set item, not raised by Magic Find or the tier. D3: kadala.csv legendary_gamble_chance (10%). A legendary roll with no unique base for the slot, class and level falls back to the rare roll'),
('loot', 'loot_buffer_seconds', NULL, 60.0, 'seconds', 'audit row 43 BufferSeconds; how long a rolled drop is held for delivery. Code comment "L5", 06-loot L5. Ours, no D3 counterpart'),
('loot', 'magic_find_legendary_efficiency_pct', 10.0, NULL, 'percent', 'from drop_rates.csv:section=magic_find|topic=item-based Magic Find (Cain''s Fate set, Nagelring only in 2.7.x).magic_find_legendary_efficiency_pct, this row''s own value column: "10% efficiency vs Legendaries". Audit row 52'),
('loot', 'magic_find_magic_efficiency_pct', 100.0, NULL, 'percent', 'from drop_rates.csv:section=magic_find|topic=item-based Magic Find (Cain''s Fate set, Nagelring only in 2.7.x).magic_find_magic_efficiency_pct, stats.csv:21 formula_for_effect, "+100% to Magic items" - sourced by Gemini, docs/research/literal-audit-sources-2.md row 54, confirming what dc_loot.h had inferred. Not stated on this row, which gives only the Rare and Legendary penalties. Audit row 54'),
('loot', 'magic_find_rare_efficiency_pct', 30.0, NULL, 'percent', 'from drop_rates.csv:section=magic_find|topic=item-based Magic Find (Cain''s Fate set, Nagelring only in 2.7.x).magic_find_rare_efficiency_pct, this row''s own value column: "30% efficiency vs Rares". Audit row 53'),
('loot', 'magic_primary_affixes', NULL, 1.0, 'count', 'diablocraft-geyf (GitHub #58). Primary affixes rolled on a Magic item. NOT a D3 number: rarity_tiers.csv says Magic has 1-2 affixes in total and the primary/secondary split is NOT PUBLISHED. 1 is the value CountsFor had compiled in (05-items I8 implementation pick, ours), moved here unchanged'),
('loot', 'magic_secondary_affixes', NULL, 1.0, 'count', 'diablocraft-geyf (GitHub #58). Secondary affixes rolled on a Magic item. NOT a D3 number: rarity_tiers.csv gives 1-2 in total, split NOT PUBLISHED. 1 is the value CountsFor had compiled in (05-items I8 implementation pick, ours), moved here unchanged'),
('loot', 'primal_chance_pct', 0.2, 0.25, 'percent', 'diablocraft-t3t8 (ruling 2026-10-10: about 0.25%, 1 in 400). The chance that a Legendary or Set drop is Primal Ancient once the account has unlocked Primals (primal_unlock_solo_gr); it takes the first slice of the roll, so the Ancient chance above is unchanged. D3: kadala.csv primal_ancient_chance (about 0.2%, 1 in 400 to 1 in 500)'),
('loot', 'primal_unlock_solo_gr', 70.0, NULL, 'level', 'diablocraft-t3t8. The solo Greater Rift level the ACCOUNT must have beaten, in the character''s mode (normal or hardcore), before a Primal Ancient can drop. D3 unlocks it once per game mode for the whole account: drop_rates.csv ancient_primal ''Primal chance'' (unlocked after solo Greater Rift 70, once per game mode), kadala.csv primal_ancient_chance (requires unlocking solo GR70 on the account). Read from dc_account_gr_solo'),
('loot', 'rift_legendary_bonus_base_pct', 25.0, NULL, 'percent', 'from drop_rates.csv:section=base_drop_by_source|topic=rift guardian (Nephalem Rift).rift_legendary_bonus_base_pct, this row''s own details column: "bonus starts at 25% (base difficulty)". Audit row 50'),
('loot', 'rift_legendary_bonus_torment_one_pct', 44.0, NULL, 'percent', 'from drop_rates.csv:section=base_drop_by_source|topic=rift guardian (Nephalem Rift).rift_legendary_bonus_torment_one_pct, this row''s own details column: "44% at Torment I". Audit row 51. Torment II upward is deliberately absent: it is not published (dc_loot.h comment L2)'),
('loot', 'smart_loot_off_class_pct', 15.0, NULL, 'percent', 'from drop_rates.csv:section=smart_loot|topic=off-class drop chance.off_class_pct, this row''s own value column: "15% of items drop with stats for a random class other than the current one". Audit row 45; the code''s 0.85 is 1 - this'),
('monk', 'binding_of_the_lost_max_stacks', NULL, 7.0, 'count', 'Binding of the Lost (diablocraft-9ao0o): how many stacks of its damage reduction the belt''s buff holds, one per Seven-Sided Strike hit on one 7 s timer. D3 states no cap (not the text, d3planner item_waist.js:776 or the power file P3_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_027.pow); the PM''s D3 reading is 7, one strike''s seven hits, so 28-35% at full (decisions 2026-10-14, 1099218ab). Read by ItemPowers StackBuff; data/legendary_powers.csv''s stack_max 7 is the cap while this is unset. A cap of 20 or more lets a Primal reduce all damage taken'),
('monk', 'blinding_flash_elite_disorient_seconds', NULL, 1.5, 'seconds', 'Blinding Flash (diablocraft-7k24o): how long an ELITE enemy is disoriented by the blind (''Elite enemies recover faster, but suffer a miss chance'': the sheet and Power/Monk_BlindingFlash.pow state no recovery time; SF_10 Hit Reduction 0.30 is the miss chance, built). The designer''s final value, card q-1014-10 (bead diablocraft-fwrjm, 2026-10-14): an elite is disoriented for 1.5 seconds (its 30% miss chance still lasts the whole blind).'),
('monk', 'crippling_wave_cone_degrees', 180.0, NULL, 'degrees', 'Crippling Wave (diablocraft-fcmj0): the width of the arc in front of the Monk in which the wave strikes (Power/Monk_CripplingWave.pow SF_6 Angle = 180, skill_targeting.csv row Crippling Wave). The core''s own cone selection is narrower, so the module strikes the enemies of this arc that the cone did not take'),
('monk', 'cyclone_strike_blast_radius_yards', 10.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Cyclone Strike: the radius of the blast around the Monk (Power/Monk_CycloneStrike.pow SF_3 ''AOE Damage Radius Base'' = 10, SF_17 the total; skill_targeting.csv ''the blast itself is radius 10''). Implosion''s SF_16 +10 raises the pull radius (the sheet''s 34), not this'),
('monk', 'cyclone_strike_pull_land_min_yards', 1.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Cyclone Strike (diablocraft-56z6v): the nearest a pulled enemy lands to the Monk (Power/Monk_CycloneStrike.pow SF_0 ''Suck In Offset From Player Min'' = 1)'),
('monk', 'cyclone_strike_pull_land_spread_yards', 8.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Cyclone Strike: how much farther than the minimum a pulled enemy may land, picked at random (Power/Monk_CycloneStrike.pow SF_6 ''Suck In Offset From Player Delta'' = 8, so 1 to 9 yards)'),
('monk', 'dashing_strike_barrage_tick_seconds', 0.1, NULL, 'seconds', 'Dashing Strike - Barrage (diablocraft-tnqei): the interval of the damage over time on the last enemy dashed through (Power/X1_Monk_DashingStrike.pow SF_11 ''A: Tick Rate'' = 0.1; SF_8 ''A: Weapon Damage Per Second'' 4.875 x SF_15 ''A: Damage Duration'' 2 is the sheet''s 975% over 2 seconds), so 20 ticks of 48.75%'),
('monk', 'deadly_reach_line_yards', 12.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Deadly Reach (diablocraft-cvm3v): how far the cast''s own line reaches on the first and second hits (Power/Monk_DeadlyReach.pow SF_4 and SF_5 ''Stage 1/2 Radius'' = 12; skill_targeting.csv range 12). The third hit''s extra enemies start where this ends.'),
('monk', 'deadly_reach_piercing_trident_area_pct', NULL, 50.0, 'percent', 'Deadly Reach - Piercing Trident: ''the second and third hits gain increased area of effect'' (monk_runes.csv; no number on the sheets or in Power/Monk_DeadlyReach.pow). The designer''s value, bead diablocraft-760kv (2026-10-14): +50% area, built as the line''s width of those two hits growing by that percent (a strip of fixed length grows in area by exactly that). 0 turns it off'),
('monk', 'deadly_reach_scattered_fists', 6.0, NULL, 'count', 'Deadly Reach - Scattered Blows: how many fists the third hit throws at random enemies (Power/Monk_DeadlyReach.pow SF_8 ''C: number of fists'' = 6); the sheet''s sentence names the radius and the damage but not the count, so whether each fist or the whole volley deals the 215% is a question on the bead'),
('monk', 'deadly_reach_stage3_reach_yards', 25.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Deadly Reach: how far the third hit reaches (Power/Monk_DeadlyReach.pow SF_20 ''Stage 3 Radius'' = 25)'),
('monk', 'deadly_reach_width_yards', 4.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Deadly Reach: the width of the line of every hit, the third hit''s longer one included (Power/Monk_DeadlyReach.pow SF_24-SF_26 ''Capsule Width'' = 4; skill_targeting.csv width 4)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_dash_icd_seconds', 0.5, NULL, 'seconds', 'Epiphany: at most one dash in this long (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_1 ''Base: Teleport Internal Cooldown Time'' = 0.5)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_dash_max_yards', 100.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Epiphany: the farthest a dash goes (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_6 ''Max Teleport Distance'' = 100). The record''s range still limits what a skill can be aimed at'),
('monk', 'epiphany_dash_min_yards', 7.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Epiphany (diablocraft-eg0m7): while it is up, a Monk attack dashes to an enemy only farther than this (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_3 ''Min Teleport Range'' = 7)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_dash_offset_yards', 5.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Epiphany: the dash lands this far short of the enemy, on the line from the Monk (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_4 ''Teleport Offset (Teleport in front of target)'' = -5)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_fireball_length_yards', 60.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Epiphany - Inner Fire: how far a generator''s piercing fireball flies along the Monk''s facing (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_26 ''D: Fireball Search Distance'' = 60)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_fireball_radius_yards', 8.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Epiphany - Inner Fire: every enemy within this distance of the fireball''s line is hit (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_28 ''D: Fireball Explode Radius'' = 8; the simulator''s line radius 8, monk.js:1075)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_missile_count', 6.0, NULL, 'count', 'Epiphany - Inner Fire: how many different enemies a non-generator''s cast throws a missile at (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_31 ''D: Fire Missile Shot Number'' = 6; simulator targets 6, monk.js:1077)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_missile_radius_yards', 50.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Epiphany - Inner Fire: how far around the Monk the missiles look for enemies, all around (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_22 ''D: Fire Missile Search Cone Radius'' = 50, SF_21 angle 360)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_move_sample_seconds', 0.1, NULL, 'seconds', 'Epiphany - Ascendance: how often the Monk''s movement is measured toward the sheet''s distance_yards (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_43 ''E: Move Distance Check Rate'' = 0.10)'),
('monk', 'epiphany_on_cast_icd_seconds', 0.5, NULL, 'seconds', 'Epiphany - Inner Fire and Soothing Mist: a cast throws fire or heals at most once in this long (Power/X1_Monk_Epiphany.pow SF_25 ''On-Attack Internal Cooldown'' = 0.5; d3planner''s simulator monk.js:1071-1085 @898918b has none)'),
('monk', 'exploding_palm_burn_tick_seconds', 0.25, NULL, 'seconds', 'Exploding Palm - Essence Burn (diablocraft-91siy): the seconds between ticks of the burn the explosion sets on nearby enemies (Power/Monk_ExplodingPalm.pow SF_28 ''E: Secondary DoT Tick Rate'' = 0.25)'),
('monk', 'exploding_palm_explosion_radius_yards', 15.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Exploding Palm (diablocraft-91siy): how far around the enemy that dies the explosion reaches (Power/Monk_ExplodingPalm.pow SF_2 ''On Death Radius Base'' = 15; SF_11 adds SF_21 ''E: Explosion Radius Bonus'' = 0; skill_targeting.csv radius 15)'),
('monk', 'fists_arc_search_radius_yards', 18.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Fists of Thunder - Bounding Light: how far from the enemy punched the arcs look for the additional enemies (Power/Monk_FistsofThunder.pow SF_12 ''B: Lightning Jump Search Radius'' = 18; the sheet''s target_count is SF_10 3)'),
('monk', 'fists_combo_frames_per_second', NULL, 60.0, 'count', 'Fists of Thunder: the frame rate the planner''s 72 frames are counted at (monk.js: its Static Charge is 360 frames for the tooltip''s 6 s). With fists_combo_window_frames (section 6.1)'),
('monk', 'fists_combo_window_frames', NULL, 72.0, 'count', 'Fists of Thunder (diablocraft-1tiy2): how long after a punch the next one still counts as the next stage of the three-hit combo, in frames at fists_combo_frames_per_second, divided by attacks per second and rounded up (ceil(72 / aps) frames). d3planner simulator monk.js:7-23 @898918b (GenSequence.step); not game data. PM 2026-10-13 (docs/research/monk/fists-of-thunder-rules.md section 1); Section 6.1 (web check ezv3q): no same-target rule, and the timeout length is on no web page, so the planner''s stays'),
('monk', 'fists_knockback_yards', 3.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Fists of Thunder - Thunderclap: the knockback of the third hit (Power/Monk_FistsofThunder.pow SF_21 ''Stage 3 Knockback Distance'' = 3)'),
('monk', 'fists_stage3_radius_yards', 6.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Fists of Thunder: the third hit splits its 400% between all enemies inside this sphere, CENTRED ON THE PRIMARY TARGET (Power/Monk_FistsofThunder.pow SF_6 ''3rd stage Target Radius'' = 6; Fandom Fists of Thunder: ''a 6 yard sphere in front of the monk, centered on the primary target''; docs/research/monk/fists-of-thunder-rules.md section 6.2, ezv3q). The power file''s SF_20 ''Stage 3 damage radius'' = 5 is unexplained and not used; no cone, no angle'),
('monk', 'harmony_check_seconds', 1.0, NULL, 'seconds', 'Harmony (diablocraft-i7ixi): how often the passive looks at the resistances items give and puts its share on All Resistance (Power/p1_Monk_Passive_Harmony.pow SF_0 ''Check Frequency'' = 1.0)'),
('monk', 'hundred_fists_assimilation_max_stacks', NULL, 10.0, 'count', 'Way of the Hundred Fists - Assimilation: how many +5% stacks of damage the rune can hold at once, each enemy hit by the third hit adding one and renewing the whole buff''s time. The sheet and the power file (SF_24 0.05, SF_25 duration) give no cap and no refresh rule. Assimilation holds at most 10 stacks: the designer''s value, bead diablocraft-760kv (cards q-1014-01..04, 2026-10-14).'),
('monk', 'hundred_fists_fury_max_stacks', 15.0, NULL, 'count', 'Way of the Hundred Fists - Fists of Fury: how many stacks of its damage over time one enemy carries (Power/Monk_WayOfTheHundredFists.pow SF_17 ''A: Max Stacks'' = 15). The tooltip says only ''can stack multiple times'''),
('monk', 'hundred_fists_fury_tick_seconds', 0.5, NULL, 'seconds', 'Way of the Hundred Fists - Fists of Fury: the interval between the damage over time''s ticks (Power/Monk_WayOfTheHundredFists.pow SF_18 ''A: Refresh Interval'' = 0.5; SF_16 ''A: damage'' 0.2 a second is the sheet''s 60% over 3 seconds)'),
('monk', 'hundred_fists_stage3_offset_yards', 5.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Way of the Hundred Fists: how far in front of the Monk the third hit''s area is centred (Power/Monk_WayOfTheHundredFists.pow SF_31 ''stage 3 aoe offset forward'' = 5). The sheets give the radius only'),
('monk', 'hundred_fists_stage3_radius_yards', 10.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Way of the Hundred Fists (diablocraft-im88g): the third hit''s area radius (Power/Monk_WayOfTheHundredFists.pow SF_30 ''stage 3 aoe radius'' = 10; skill_targeting.csv row ''AoE radius 10'')'),
('monk', 'hundred_fists_wave_range_yards', 40.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Way of the Hundred Fists - Windforce Flurry: how far ahead of the Monk the wave carries (Power/Monk_WayOfTheHundredFists.pow SF_13 ''E: range'' = 40). The sheet says only ''directly ahead of you'''),
('monk', 'hundred_fists_wave_width_yards', NULL, 5.0, 'yards', 'Way of the Hundred Fists - Windforce Flurry: how wide the wave is. No sheet, power file label or web page gives a width (the power file has SF_14 ''E: radius (NOT USED)'' = 70). Windforce Flurry''s wave is 5 yards wide: the designer''s value, bead diablocraft-760kv (cards q-1014-01..04, 2026-10-14).'),
('monk', 'inner_sanctuary_tick_seconds', 0.3, NULL, 'seconds', 'Inner Sanctuary (diablocraft-yyglx): how often the circle does what its runes do to whoever stands in it (Safe Haven''s heal, paid per tick as its share of a second; Temple of Protection''s immunity taken on; Forbidden Palace''s slow renewed; Sanctified Ground''s push back to the edge). Power/X1_Monk_InnerSanctuary.pow SF_6 ''Tick Interval'' = 0.3. Blank = no ticks: the circle still cuts damage taken'),
('monk', 'lashing_tail_kick_column_width_yards', NULL, 5.0, 'yards', 'Lashing Tail Kick - Spinning Flame Kick: how wide the column of fire is, the strip in which an enemy is struck. Neither the sheet nor Power/Monk_LashingTailKick.pow (SF_16 distance 50, SF_25 speed 0.8, no width) gives one. The column is 5 yards wide: the designer''s value, bead diablocraft-760kv (cards q-1014-01..04, 2026-10-14).'),
('monk', 'lashing_tail_kick_column_yards', 50.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Lashing Tail Kick - Spinning Flame Kick: how far ahead of the Monk the column of fire runs (Power/Monk_LashingTailKick.pow SF_16 ''B: Projectile Distance'' = 50)'),
('monk', 'lashing_tail_kick_cone_degrees', 180.0, NULL, 'degrees', 'Lashing Tail Kick (diablocraft-m2bk4): the width of the arc in front of the Monk in which the kick strikes (Power/Monk_LashingTailKick.pow SF_7 ''Target Cone Angle'' = 180, SF_6 radius 10; skill_targeting.csv row Lashing Tail Kick). The core''s own cone selection is narrower, so the module strikes the enemies of this arc that the cone did not take'),
('monk', 'lashing_tail_kick_dot_tick_seconds', NULL, 1.0, 'seconds', 'Lashing Tail Kick - Vulture Claw Kick: the interval between the ticks of the burn (230% over 3 seconds: Power/Monk_LashingTailKick.pow SF_26 scalar 2.3, SF_27 duration 3). No sheet and no power file in hand gives the tick length. The burn ticks once a second: the designer''s value, bead diablocraft-760kv (cards q-1014-01..04, 2026-10-14).'),
('monk', 'lashing_tail_kick_knockback_gravity', -0.05, NULL, 'count', 'Lashing Tail Kick: the power file''s ''Knockback Gravity'' (Power/Monk_LashingTailKick.pow SF_5 = -0.05). Kept as the D3 number; not read by the code: the throw is the stock knockback record'),
('monk', 'lashing_tail_kick_knockback_height', 2.0, NULL, 'count', 'Lashing Tail Kick: the power file''s ''Knockback Height'' (Power/Monk_LashingTailKick.pow SF_4 = 2.0 x SF_23 1). Kept as the D3 number; not read by the code: the stock knockback record''s vertical speed is baked into it (pylon_speed_knockup_speed_z)'),
('monk', 'lashing_tail_kick_knockback_magnitude', NULL, NULL, 'count', 'Lashing Tail Kick (every rune): the power file''s ''Total Knockback Magnitude'' (Power/Monk_LashingTailKick.pow SF_3 = SF_22 ''Base Knockback Magnitude'' 45 x SF_23 ''D: Extra Knockback %'' 1). The unit of 45 is in neither the file nor the stock knockback record (whose speeds are yards per second, tenths in the record), so no value is entered. Blank = not read; the throw uses the stock record''s baked speeds (pylon_speed_knockup_speed_xy and _z). A question on diablocraft-m2bk4'),
('monk', 'mantra_healing_pulse_seconds', 1.0, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mantra of Healing (diablocraft-wv17q): the seconds between pulses of the passive aura, each healing the Monk and its group once (Power/X1_Monk_MantraOfHealing_v2.pow SF_18 ''Base Periodic TickRate'' = 1)'),
('monk', 'mantra_of_conviction_ally_radius_yards', 60.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mantra of Conviction - Annihilation: the allies within this distance of the Monk share the speed (Power/X1_Monk_MantraOfConviction_v2.pow SF_23 ''D: Search Radius'' = 60)'),
('monk', 'mantra_of_conviction_hold_seconds', 0.6, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mantra of Conviction: how long an enemy keeps the aura''s mark after a tick, so it lapses soon after the enemy leaves the radius (Power/X1_Monk_MantraOfConviction_v2.pow SF_3 ''B: Debuff Damage Duration'' = SF_4 + 0.1)'),
('monk', 'mantra_of_conviction_tick_seconds', 0.5, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mantra of Conviction (diablocraft-mrpzh): how often the aura marks the enemies within its radius, and Submission''s damage tick (Power/X1_Monk_MantraOfConviction_v2.pow SF_4 ''Aura Tick Rate'' = 0.5; simulator tickrate 30 frames, monk.js:1197)'),
('monk', 'mantra_of_retribution_buff_tick_seconds', 1.0, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mantra of Retribution - Transgression (diablocraft-2rjqh): how often the aura looks again at who stands within its reach and gives them the attack speed (Power/X1_Monk_MantraOfRetribution_v2.pow SF_8 ''applied buff duration'' = 1: the aura re-applies a 1 second buff)'),
('monk', 'mantra_of_retribution_detonation_radius_yards', 8.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mantra of Retribution - Collateral Damage: how far around the enemy hit the feedback blast reaches (Power/X1_Monk_MantraOfRetribution_v2.pow SF_20 ''E: detonation area'' = 8). The sheet says only ''nearby enemies'''),
('monk', 'mantra_of_retribution_spirit_chance_pct', NULL, 25.0, 'percent', 'Mantra of Retribution - Against All Odds: the chance, per reflected hit, to restore its Spirit. The sheet says only ''has a chance'' and the power file has SF_23 ''D: spirit gained'' = 3 and no chance. The designer''s final value, card q-1014-11 (bead diablocraft-fwrjm, 2026-10-14): 25% per reflected hit.'),
('monk', 'mantra_salvation_hold_seconds', 1.2, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mantra of Salvation: how long one pulse of the passive aura lasts on a holder, so it lapses 1.2 seconds after the Monk stops or the ally leaves the radius (Power/X1_Monk_MantraOfEvasion_v2.pow SF_11 ''Friendly Buff Duration'' = 1.2)'),
('monk', 'mantra_salvation_pulse_seconds', 1.0, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mantra of Salvation (diablocraft-puvah): how often the passive aura is handed out again to the Monk and its group (Power/X1_Monk_MantraOfEvasion_v2.pow SF_15 ''Application Tick Rate'' = 1; D3 renamed Evasion to Salvation)'),
('monk', 'momentum_tick_seconds', 0.1, NULL, 'seconds', 'Momentum: how often the yards moved are sampled (Power/X1_Monk_Passive_Momentum.pow SF_3 ''Tick Rate'' = 0.1). The power file also checks every SF_4 ''Ticks Before Checking'' = 3 ticks against SF_5 ''Yards Before Update Total'' = 25 / 3, which the tooltip''s ''Moving 25 yards'' does not state; the sheet''s 25 yards total is what is built'),
('monk', 'monkey_kings_garb_decoy_empty_offset_yards', 5.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Monkey King''s Garb 4-piece (diablocraft-w7wes): how far in front of the Monk the decoy is put when no enemy has been hit ("next to the last enemy you hit"). d3_value is the set''s power file: Power/P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043_SpawnDecoy.pow SF_1 ''Offset From Player If No Enemies'' 5 (the 4-piece''s set bonus record Monkey_King_Set_x1 (4) grants P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043; reference/blizzless-diiis Core*.mpq, mod-diablocraft/scripts/decode_pow.py power P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043_SpawnDecoy). Zero builds no decoy'),
('monk', 'monkey_kings_garb_decoy_explode_delay_seconds', 0.5, NULL, 'seconds', 'Monkey King''s Garb 4-piece (diablocraft-w7wes): how long the decoy holds the taunt before it explodes. d3_value is the set''s power file: Power/P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043_SpawnDecoy.pow SF_2 ''Delay Before Explosion'' 0.5 (the 4-piece''s set bonus record Monkey_King_Set_x1 (4) grants P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043; reference/blizzless-diiis Core*.mpq, mod-diablocraft/scripts/decode_pow.py power P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043_SpawnDecoy). Zero builds no decoy'),
('monk', 'monkey_kings_garb_decoy_explode_radius_yards', 15.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Monkey King''s Garb 4-piece (diablocraft-w7wes): how far from the decoy an enemy is hit by its explosion (the number the explosion deals is legendary_powers.csv''s). d3_value is the set''s power file: Power/P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043_SpawnDecoy.pow SF_4 ''Explosion Radius'' 15 (the 4-piece''s set bonus record Monkey_King_Set_x1 (4) grants P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043; reference/blizzless-diiis Core*.mpq, mod-diablocraft/scripts/decode_pow.py power P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043_SpawnDecoy). Zero builds no decoy'),
('monk', 'monkey_kings_garb_decoy_taunt_radius_yards', 15.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Monkey King''s Garb 4-piece (diablocraft-w7wes): how far from the decoy an enemy is taunted to attack it. d3_value is the set''s power file: Power/P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043_SpawnDecoy.pow SF_3 ''Taunt Radius'' 15 (the 4-piece''s set bonus record Monkey_King_Set_x1 (4) grants P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043; reference/blizzless-diiis Core*.mpq, mod-diablocraft/scripts/decode_pow.py power P4_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_043_SpawnDecoy). Zero builds no decoy'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_boots_form_duration_pct', NULL, 50.0, 'percent', 'The Crudest Boots (diablocraft-x1tg0): ''Mystic Ally summons two Mystic Allies ... able to attack with their active forms longer'' states no time (the catalogue''s P71 text; d3planner''s older entry has the first sentence only). The designer''s value, card q-1014-20 (option c, 2026-10-14): each active form lasts this percent longer while the Boots are worn, by its own duration (Earth Ally''s boulder, Fire Ally''s fuse cap, the base Active''s damage window); 50 = half as long again.'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_earth_knockback_yards', 0.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mystic Ally - Earth Ally: how far the boulder''s knock-up carries an enemy sideways (power file SF_29 ''C: Knockback Magnitude'' = 0: straight up, with SF_30''s height)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_earth_knockup_height_yards', 2.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mystic Ally - Earth Ally: how high an enemy the boulder reaches is knocked up, once a boulder (power file SF_30 ''C: Knockback Height'' = 2, SF_29 magnitude 0: straight up; the stock knockback, PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_earth_radius_yards', 7.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mystic Ally - Earth Ally: the boulder hits every enemy this close to it (power file SF_28 ''C: Damage radius'' = 7; PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_earth_search_radius_yards', 40.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mystic Ally - Earth Ally: the boulder rolls toward the nearest enemy within this distance of the Monk (power file SF_24 ''C: Target Find Radius (of Owner)'' = 40; PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_earth_speed_yards_per_second', NULL, 8.0, 'yards per second', 'Mystic Ally - Earth Ally: the boulder''s rolling speed. The power file''s SF_20 0.3 is in no known unit; the designer''s final value, card q-1014-05 (a), set by bead diablocraft-760kv (2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_earth_tick_seconds', 0.2, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mystic Ally - Earth Ally: the boulder''s damage tick; each pays this share of the sheet''s 4500% a second (power file SF_26 ''C: Periodic Damage Tick Rate'' = 0.2; PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_fire_explosion_radius_yards', 4.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mystic Ally - Fire Ally: the radius of each exploding ally''s 1920% (power file SF_13 ''A: Explosion Radius'' = 4; PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_fire_max_seconds', 6.0, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mystic Ally - Fire Ally: the exploding allies explode where they are when this runs out without reaching an enemy (power file SF_12 ''A: Summoned Guys MAX Duration'' = 6; PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_fire_search_radius_yards', 80.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mystic Ally - Fire Ally: how far the Active''s exploding allies look for an enemy to run at (power file SF_41 ''A: Target Search Radius'' = 80; PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_life_pct', 100.0, NULL, 'percent', 'Mystic Ally (diablocraft-a0vq0): the ally''s Life as a share of the Monk''s maximum Life when it is summoned (Power/X1_Monk_MysticAlly_v2.pow SF_34 ''Pet HP Scalar %'' = 1; PM default 2026-10-14, as Call of the Ancients'' ancients_life_pct_of_owner)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_water_wave_interval_seconds', 0.2, NULL, 'seconds', 'Mystic Ally - Water Ally: the time between the Active''s 7 waves (power file SF_45 ''B: Wave Tick Rate'' = 0.2; PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_water_wave_length_yards', NULL, 15.0, 'yards', 'Mystic Ally - Water Ally: how far ahead of the ally each wave reaches. No source gives it; the designer''s final value, card q-1014-05 (a), set by bead diablocraft-760kv (2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mystic_ally_water_wave_radius_yards', 5.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Mystic Ally - Water Ally: half the width of each wave, a strip ahead of the ally (power file SF_43 ''B: Wave Attack Cylinder Radius'' = 5; PM 2026-10-14)'),
('monk', 'mythic_rhythm_generator_hits', 3.0, NULL, 'count', 'Mythic Rhythm: every this many Spirit Generator hits arm the sheet''s damage_bonus_pct on the next damaging Spirit Spender (the passive''s text, reference/d3planner/data.json passivetips.monk.mythicrhythm: ''Every third hit from a Spirit Generator increases the damage of your next damaging Spirit Spender by 40%''; Power/X1_Monk_Passive_MythicRhythm.pow SF_1 3, as monk_passive_values.csv''s max_stacks_count row cites it); Architect ruling decisions.md 2026-10-15'),
('monk', 'near_death_experience_knockback_radius_yards', 25.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Near Death Experience: the enemies this close when it saves you are thrown back (Power/Monk_Passive_NearDeathExperience.pow SF_3 ''Knockback Search Radius'' = 25); PM ruling decisions.md 2bb8979d7'),
('monk', 'near_death_experience_knockback_yards', 15.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Near Death Experience: how far an enemy within the radius is knocked back (Power/Monk_Passive_NearDeathExperience.pow SF_4 ''Knockback Magnitude'' = 15, read as yards the way Tempest Rush''s SF_6 8 is: PM ruling); SF_5 height 1.5 and SF_6 gravity -0.075 are the ability knockback''s own arc, ability_knockback_speed_xy/z'),
('monk', 'rabid_strike_search_radius_yards', 15.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Rabid Strike (diablocraft-6d1jb): while Epiphany is up, the copy of a Spirit spender Epiphany''s dash teleported goes to the nearest other enemy within this many yards of the Monk (Power/P43_ItemPassive_Unique_Ring_003.pow SF_0 ''Target Search Radius'' = 15, the Rabid Strike item''s power; decode_pow.py). 0: no copy'),
('monk', 'serenity_pulse_seconds', 0.99, NULL, 'seconds', 'Serenity - Unwelcome Disturbance (diablocraft-umi1o): the interval between the pulses that strike the enemies around the Monk while the shield lasts, the first one interval after the cast (Power/Monk_Serenity.pow SF_15 ''E: Explosion Tick Rate'' = 0.99; the sheet says ''every second'')'),
('monk', 'seven_sided_strike_burn_tick_seconds', NULL, 1.0, 'seconds', 'Seven-Sided Strike - Incinerate: the interval between the ticks of each strike''s burn (630% over 3 seconds: Power/Monk_SevenSidedStrike.pow SF_24 scalar 6.3, SF_25 duration 3). No sheet and not the power file gives the tick length (d3planner''s model ticks every 30 frames, monk.js:858-863 @898918b, not game data). 1 s is the PM default (docs/decisions.md 2026-10-14), the same as the designer''s answer for Vulture Claw Kick''s burn (q-1014-04); blank = no burn'),
('monk', 'seven_sided_strike_first_strike_seconds', 0.1, NULL, 'seconds', 'Seven-Sided Strike (diablocraft-7kbmf): when the first of the strikes lands after the cast (Power/Monk_SevenSidedStrike.pow SF_4 ''Attack Delay Initial'' = 0.100; d3planner simulator monk.js:887-889 @898918b, tickinitial 6 frames of 60)'),
('monk', 'seven_sided_strike_interval_seconds', 0.15, NULL, 'seconds', 'Seven-Sided Strike: the time between one strike and the next (Power/Monk_SevenSidedStrike.pow: SF_2 ''Total Time'' 1.3 less SF_4 0.1 and SF_16 ''Attack Delay End'' 0.3, over the six gaps between SF_1''s 7 strikes = 0.15; d3planner simulator monk.js:887-889 @898918b, tickrate 9 frames of 60, the same). The skill''s cooldown starts again when the last strike lands (the tooltip''s ''does not start its cooldown until after its effects expire'')'),
('monk', 'seven_sided_strike_teleport_yards', 50.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Seven-Sided Strike - Sudden Assault: how far away the enemy the Monk teleports to may be (Power/Monk_SevenSidedStrike.pow SF_19 ''A: Max Teleport Distance'' = 50). Further than this, the strikes start from where the Monk stands, as the skill''s'),
('monk', 'sweeping_wind_tick_seconds', 0.25, NULL, 'seconds', 'Sweeping Wind (diablocraft-348cz): the interval between the vortex''s damage ticks (Power/Monk_SweepingWind.pow SF_11 ''Vortex Tick-Interval'' = 0.25). The sheet''s damage_pct is a second''s worth for one stack (SF_14 ''Damage Increase Per Second Per Stack''), so a tick pays this share of it'),
('monk', 'sweeping_wind_tornado_arcs', 1.0, NULL, 'count', 'Sweeping Wind - Cyclone: how many enemies each of the tornado''s arcs strikes (Power/Monk_SweepingWind.pow SF_32 ''C: Lightning Arcs Max Number'' = 1)'),
('monk', 'sweeping_wind_tornado_seek_yards', 30.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Sweeping Wind - Cyclone: how far from the tornado its lightning looks for an enemy (Power/Monk_SweepingWind.pow SF_30 ''C: Lightning Seek Radius'' = 30)'),
('monk', 'sweeping_wind_tornado_tick_seconds', 0.6, NULL, 'seconds', 'Sweeping Wind - Cyclone: the interval between the lightning tornado''s arcs (Power/Monk_SweepingWind.pow SF_28 ''C: Lightning Arc Tick Interval'' = 0.6); the tornado lasts the sheet''s duration_seconds (SF_21 3)'),
('monk', 'tempest_rush_field_tick_seconds', 0.25, NULL, 'seconds', 'Tempest Rush - Electric Field: the interval of its lightning (Power/Monk_TempestRush.pow SF_27 ''C: Lightning Tick Rate'' = 0.25); the sheet''s 135% is for a second, each tick deals the share'),
('monk', 'tempest_rush_flurry_max_stacks', 100.0, NULL, 'count', 'Tempest Rush - Flurry: how many attack periods of channeling the explosion counts (Power/Monk_TempestRush.pow SF_36 ''E: Max Stacks'' = 100; one stack per attack period, SF_34 ''Weapon Damage Per Attack Period'')'),
('monk', 'tempest_rush_knockback_yards', 8.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Tempest Rush: how far an enemy hit is knocked back, once for the channel, by the skill and every rune (Power/Monk_TempestRush.pow SF_6 ''Damage Knockback Magnitude'' = 8; SF_7 height 0.5 and SF_8 gravity -0.075 are the ability knockback''s own arc, ability_knockback_speed_xy/z)'),
('monk', 'tempest_rush_radius_yards', 7.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Tempest Rush (diablocraft-ogwtu): the reach of the damage around the Monk while it runs (Power/Monk_TempestRush.pow SF_2 ''Damage Capsule Radius'' = 7; skill_targeting.csv radius 7)'),
('monk', 'tempest_rush_tick_seconds', 0.2, NULL, 'seconds', 'Tempest Rush: the channel''s damage and Spirit-cost tick (Power/Monk_TempestRush.pow SF_5 ''Damage Tick Interval'' = 0.2): each tick deals the per-second damage times this and pays the per-second cost times this'),
('monk', 'unity_ally_max_stacks', 4.0, NULL, 'count', 'Unity: how many Monks'' Unity one ally''s 5% can stack from (Power/X1_Monk_Passive_Unity.pow SF_3 ''Max Stacks Per Ally Buff'' = 4); the sheet''s maximum of 20% is the Monk''s own'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_bell_offset_yards', 10.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Wave of Light (diablocraft-dkf8w): how far ahead of the Monk the bell falls, along the direction of the ground point the cast aimed at (Power/Monk_WaveOfLight.pow SF_8 ''Bell Offset Distance'' = 10 for the skill and runes A, D and E; 0 for Explosive Light and Pillar of the Ancients)'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_bell_radius_yards', NULL, 10.0, 'yards', 'Wave of Light: the radius around the bell inside which enemies take the skill''s hit (for Explosive Light, around the Monk). The power file gives no base radius (skill_targeting.csv: ''the base damage radius is not in the power''; only the pillar''s 15 is stated). The bell strikes within 10 yards: the designer''s value, bead diablocraft-760kv (cards q-1014-01..04, 2026-10-14).'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_bell_ticks', 3.0, NULL, 'count', 'Wave of Light: how many ticks the bell''s damage is shared over, the first at once and the rest evenly across 1 / attacks per second (Power/Monk_WaveOfLight.pow SF_11 ''Bell Damage Num Ticks'' = 3 over SF_10 ''Bell Damage Duration'' = 1 / Attacks_Per_Second_Total). The sheet''s 835% / 1045% is the total of the ticks (PM ruling). Explosive Light is one burst'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_line_end_yards', 50.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Wave of Light - Shattering Light: where the line ends (Power/Monk_WaveOfLight.pow SF_1 ''Wave Projectile End Distance'' = 50)'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_line_start_yards', 1.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Wave of Light - Shattering Light: where the line starts, ahead of the Monk (Power/Monk_WaveOfLight.pow SF_0 ''Wave Projectile Start Distance'' = 1)'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_line_width_yards', NULL, 5.0, 'yards', 'Wave of Light - Shattering Light: how wide the line is. No sheet or power file label gives a width. Shattering Light''s line is 5 yards wide: the designer''s value, bead diablocraft-760kv (cards q-1014-01..04, 2026-10-14).'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_pillar_offset_yards', 10.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Wave of Light - Pillar of the Ancients: how far ahead of the Monk the pillar stands (Power/Monk_WaveOfLight.pow SF_28 ''C: Temple Offset Distance'' = 10)'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_pillar_radius_yards', 15.0, NULL, 'yards', 'Wave of Light - Pillar of the Ancients: the radius of the pillar''s first hit and of its damage over time (Power/Monk_WaveOfLight.pow SF_13 ''C: Drop Damage Radius'', SF_26 ''C: Temple Impact Radius'' and SF_35 ''C: Temple Pillar Damage Radius'' are all 15)'),
('monk', 'wave_of_light_pillar_tick_seconds', 0.5, NULL, 'seconds', 'Wave of Light - Pillar of the Ancients: the interval between its damage over time''s ticks (Power/Monk_WaveOfLight.pow SF_5 ''C: Shock Tick Rate'' = 0.5); the sheet''s dot_duration_seconds is divided by it'),
('monk', 'won_khim_lau_cooldown_seconds', NULL, 0.0, 'seconds', 'Won Khim Lau (diablocraft-vbm0q): how long after one Cyclone Strike the item casts on a Tempest Rush hit the next can come. D3''s text states none and the proc''s Power file (SNO 484106) is not in our client data; ruling q-1014-14 (a): 0, no cooldown, so every Tempest Rush tick that hits (tempest_rush_tick_seconds) casts one'),
('monsters', 'ability_anarch_flame_breath_cooldown_s', NULL, NULL, 'seconds', 'diablocraft-uole (o18f); docs/proposals/monster-families.md Part 1 (ruling q-1007-05). The cooldown of Anarch''s Flame Breath is not published (no Blizzard value, no WoW donor value): yours to set. PLACEHOLDER, blank until you set it; until then Part 3 runs the ability on its kind''s default. Read at run time (dc_tunables, .dc tunables set monsters ability_anarch_flame_breath_cooldown_s <n>, .dc tunables reload); the sheet cell stays blank'),
