('rifts', 'gr_urshi_tries_base', 3.0, NULL, 'count', 'Greater Rift part 11 (diablocraft-z94g; azerothcore-wotlk/build/_agent-scratch/urshi-2026-10-07/brief.md, ruling 2026-10-07): upgrade tries each run member gets from Urshi. greater_rifts.csv gem_upgrade_attempts: 3 base attempts'),
('rifts', 'gr_urshi_tries_no_death_bonus', 1.0, NULL, 'count', 'Greater Rift part 11 (diablocraft-z94g; azerothcore-wotlk/build/_agent-scratch/urshi-2026-10-07/brief.md, ruling 2026-10-07): tries added for a member who did not die in the run (a Hardcore character always gets it). greater_rifts.csv gem_upgrade_attempts: +1 if no death in the rift. The +1 for an empowered rift stays on hold'),
