('rifts', 'open_rift_entry_x', NULL, -7900.5913, 'yards', 'Un''Goro rift copy (diablocraft-2yb2; ruling 2026-10-09, his .gps on map 751, zone 490, area 490, the crater''s south side): the x of the one entrance point of the open-world rift copy (map 751). It is where .dc openrift puts you, where the zone-edge bounce sends you back, and the rift start for the real build. Server side only: the client Map.dbc CorpseX/CorpseY stay as they are (the Marshal''s Refuge graveyard), which is only where a ghost looks for a graveyard. Read by dc_open_rift.cpp when used.'),
