('rifts', 'shrine_fortune_weight', NULL, NULL, 'multiplier', 'Pylons and shrines P4 (6.5, 6.2): the weight of a Fortune Shrine against 1 for each other kind when a shrine''s kind is picked. D3 makes Fortune ''much rarer'' (D6) and publishes no number; BLANK until ALEX SETS IT, and a blank row means no Fortune Shrine ever stands'),
('rifts', 'solo_share_pct', NULL, 10.0, 'percent', 'Monster spawning S1 (diablocraft-dt7c; docs/proposals/monster-spawning.md 3.4, 4.6 (a), ruled by ruling 2026-10-08): the share of picked anchors that hold a solo monster instead of a cluster, when the set has one'),
